{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日お疲れ様です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は昨日久しぶりに外へ出ました。\n親友が色々な所へ連れて行ってくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずはクリスマスマーケット。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は人生初めてのクリスマスマーケットでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのオーナメントを見て\nあまりにもキラキラしていたので\nガラスのツリーや手描きのオーナメントなど\n気づけばたくさん購入してしまっていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして夕方頃にはツリーが\nキラキラ輝いていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19EJH7EKDTM6X48HYVXJ6J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19EKGP00B6QBECH0QFNBAP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19EMH6YA6027ZJ47ADY6NR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19ENJQR995MZ6Q7H2QZT9K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19EPJ72BYH607QBTA2WRCE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19EQJXCTXC2M3S0N53NJYP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポーズは親友に指定してもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方頃から青の洞窟へ行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここも初めての場所です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イルミネーションが大好きなので\n本当に青色の世界を歩いている時は\n何も考えず、上を見ながら歩いたりして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただただキラキラした青い世界に\n引き込まれていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでイルミネーションってこんなに綺麗で\n心まで澄んでいくように感じるのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19ERN198RY30RKGRKX695V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19ESKTNG7M0ENKP10NF0X0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19ETM1CZ47XPNHVBE7TZ1N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも親友にポーズを指定して\n撮ってもらった写真です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の写真は親友と共に撮っていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは趣味に付き合ってくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19EVKD0ME1N854RGY2NGVV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19EWPSND2ZG32SW0CH4W1D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなナナミン。\nお家にグッズが増えていく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この幸せ感。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はたくさんの場所へ行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが今の私は外へ行くことへ、\n未だにかなり抵抗があります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも私の親友はそれを理解していて、\n親友自身に負担や重荷になることも理解して\n一緒にいてくれるような人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までも何度も誘ってくれていましたが、\nやっぱり無理だ、という日は\n私の家に来てくれて一緒にお菓子作りなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の好きだったことを\n思い出させてくれるようにしてくれていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昔からたくさんたくさん\n思い出を作ってくれる大切な人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はずっとずっと、手を繋いでいてくれて\nなるべく外へ緊張しないようにと\nさり気なく気遣ってくれていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は私の気持ちに寄り添いつつ、\n気晴らしに、と私の\n「行きたい」や「好きな場所」へ\n連れ出してくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこまでも優しすぎるけれど、\nそれを口にせず行動にしてくれる親友に\n本当にどこまでも救われています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19EXS4JT9YRTE86HNRJK00","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も少し緊張していましたが、\n何も無く心が一番楽しいと理解して\nその場を楽しめていたことが\n私自身嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつ、少しずつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おまけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ19EYR7BX7KT3A1BSWZBCQ8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"}],"source":"archive"}